  "description": "KACYEW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H150 Cl6 Nd4 O30 Zr4. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Zr1 (Zr) has 6 O neighbors; Zr2 (Zr) has 6 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Zr3 (Zr) has 6 O neighbors; Zr4 (Zr) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.409-4.272 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.58-126.50°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C56H150O30Cl6Nd4Zr4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
